            "text": "spine"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "). Work along one side: sl st, dc, htr, 3 tr in tip ch, then work back along the other side: htr, dc, sl st to base. The double-ended chain gives the two sides of each leaf. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thread each leaf onto the jute twine through the slip stitch at its base. Alternate colours. Space leaves 10 cm apart. Knot cord ends for hanging."
          }
        ]
      },
